<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Focus Tracker · Pomodoro timer that remembers your work</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A Pomodoro timer with breaks that saves every focus session and shows how much you got done today.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="top">
      <span class="brand">Focus Tracker</span>
      <a class="link" href="/login">Log in</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Focus. Break. Repeat. See what you got done.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Phone timers forget every session. Focus Tracker saves each one by category, so you can see where your study time actually went this week.</p>
        <p class="cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">Start focusing</a>
          <span class="note">Free, no email needed.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Preview of the timer, drawn with HTML and CSS only. Every chip is a feature that exists in the app. -->
      <div class="device-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="chip chip-a"><i class="dot seg-study"></i>Study · 50/10</span>
      <span class="chip chip-b">This week <b>6h 20m</b></span>
      <span class="chip chip-c"><i class="mini-bars"><i class="seg-study"></i><i class="seg-work"></i><i class="seg-reading"></i></i>Reports by category</span>
      <div class="device">
        <div class="modes"><span class="mode on">Focus</span><span class="mode">Short break</span><span class="mode">Long break</span></div>
        <div class="preview-ring">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="pr-track"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="pr-fill"></circle></svg>
          <div class="pr-center"><span>Odin Project Node</span><b>18:42</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="screen-dots"><i class="done"></i><i class="done"></i><i class="now"></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="pr-buttons"><i></i><i class="play"></i><i></i></div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" aria-label="Features">
      <article class="tile"><h2>Categories + to-do</h2><p>Tag each session as study, reading, work or journal, and link it to a task on your list.</p></article>
      <article class="tile"><h2>Pomodoro presets</h2><p>25/5 for study, 50/10 for coding, 90/20 for deep work or 15/3 to get started. Breaks start on their own.</p></article>
      <article class="tile"><h2>Reports</h2><p>Minutes per day for today, 7 or 30 days, split by category, so you see where your week went.</p></article>
    </section>

    <section class="built" aria-label="Built with">
      <h2>Built with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Express</li><li>PostgreSQL (Neon)</li><li>Passport</li><li>Tests + GitHub Actions CI</li><li>Docker</li><li>Render</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="link" href="https://github.com/vy-trg/focus-tracker">Source on GitHub</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
